# Orphaned 'visualizer' branch: it carries ONLY the viz/ tool, this README, and
# this .gitignore. Everything else physically present in the worktree -- the MIEM
# source materialized from the parent checkout, screenshots, IDE files, build
# output -- is local scratch and deliberately ignored, so `git status` stays
# clean and `git add` can't pull the MIEM tree onto this branch.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/viz/
